Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:27.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}只是身在福中不知福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:30.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}火光亮起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:32.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}指引方向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:38.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}回憶中響起了溫柔旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:44.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世無永恆 萬物皆為雲煙
